            "tag": "h1",
            "text": "International Journal of Digital Application and Contemporary Research (IJDACR)"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "IJDACR is an research paper publication house involved in publishing original research trades for Engineering & Science. IJDACR is one of the most indexed and top growing monthly international journal in its field with great impact factor of 4.666 . IJDACR journal provides the authors a platform of global level to represent their research work. IJDACR publish its issue every month in every domain of engineering, science & digital application ranging from topics on NLP AI,ML,DEEP learning, VLSI, Computer science, Electrical Engineering, Embedded Systems, Image Processing, Robotics, Information Technology,Civil Engineering, Thermal Engineering, Mechanical Engineering. The aim of IJDACR is to give an open access, peer review and scholarly platforms to academics researchers, scholars, scientists, and engineers to trade their research papers, articles, thesis, case studies, survey papers and review papers publication."
          },
